{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64d1fe2907e88919185da4933cde648ceea8cbad274cf4eb791ce760c2da52fc",
      "text": "就在同一时间……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa04d3b34b92f803185707456784709e5d148f106573f5aeeb202734a22abdb6",
      "text": "今天也辛苦了喵！肚子也饿了，\n接下来去吃个大餐怎么样喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aedc88cbdef6e8475fef0348ab9790ba9c4981273c7418a085c76062f53889e",
      "text": "大家一起去庆功吗。\n挺好的呢♪……哎呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccabdd83e980d451726c720c0467e28746e886ad562abf7ee63a41fa5f772d8f",
      "text": "好久不见，翔真！我听到传闻了哦。\n听说你组了一个叫彩的偶像组合？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43144d3067d83275344650c58d867aeecde5701c8eabe742de4fbecad0a4850c",
      "text": "下次我们看看能不能一起合作工作。\n到时就拜托啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cce62ae099c8bfc0ac77b58ce48bde14d829a00ad487b278fb77be4ed8568239",
      "text": "（那个人，我记得是食品行业的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e833baeba7344f598a6a84f799b789ae612d4db78fef5eac7f6e0d555520715d",
      "text": "华村，刚才那位是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9577ff2e80430c171afc28c6d150e957fa8fef32f89ca8494723e323f3b1a150",
      "text": "唔唔。总觉得吾辈等人要有好事发生了喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78d7244793ff288cf0f0aa425dd883419ccded465aac61cd6052004c7d5022b9",
      "text": "呵呵，只是熟人啦。不过，说得也是呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c38c03cfe49db411ef9a667257f83612f91433311b5d6f4bf50cd19026494d",
      "text": "说不定真如小哥预感的那样，\n我们也要迎来好机会了呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf61ac67ad424fbd2f4344db28e7e644b65dd2bc015fadff4ce324d4ba8c33c2",
      "text": "那莫非是……能让彩更加活跃、\n让茶道人口进一步增加的好事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1d7e0fef5af0078ecd9221bdfc22c5659d945870099f71915140e04b9cac77",
      "text": "哎呀讨厌，干劲的开关被按下了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346c73b32912daaf07c055f4a53c9c47a0cb699a33a817ac82cd7510dbd900be",
      "text": "两位，庆功取消了。为了无论何种机会\n到来都能接得住，我们这就回去做准备吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
